    "title": "MICROSERVICE_DEV_Traffic Signal Status API",
    "description": "The Traffic Signal Status API allows users to access real-time information about the operational status of traffic signals within a specified area. This endpoint provides vital updates on signal functionality, including whether signals are active, malfunctioning, or under maintenance. It is designed for urban planners, traffic management authorities, and developers creating transportation apps that require up-to-date signal data for optimizing traffic flow. Use cases may include routing, traffic analysis, and incident management to enhance urban mobility.",
    "version": "1.0"
  },
